    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Whoa, that's a really strong take. I wasn't expecting such a stark divide between them. When you say the landscape is \"merely a technical exercise\" and \"shallow,\" are you saying that Western classical traditions lack the conceptual complexity found in these other cultural works? I'm trying to understand if you think there's an inherent difference in the level of intellectualism between the two styles.",
